TASK
====
Generate up to 3 bilingual background-validation questions that verify this
candidate's hands-on experience with the SKILLS this role lists — both the
Required skills and the Preferred skills above. Each question must target a
specific named skill from those lists (prefer required skills first; cover
preferred skills if the cap allows) and ask how recently and in what context
the candidate used it, or for a concrete example. Skills ONLY — do NOT ask
about work history, employer/job title, employment dates, reason for leaving,
references, or any topic already covered by the fixed questions (salary, visa,
notice period, employment type, work mode, reason for job-seeking), and do not
ask about nationality. Follow the system instructions exactly. Output JSON only.
